values (5, $q$web-development-course-html-css-javascript$q$, $q$Web Development Course (HTML, CSS & JavaScript)$q$, $q$web$q$, 2199, 4999, $q$3 Months$q$, $q$Build responsive websites from scratch, with a GitHub portfolio, live hosting and capstone projects.$q$, $q$Build real websites instead of only watching theory. You begin with HTML and CSS, move on to responsive layouts and JavaScript, and finish with capstone projects that you publish online with GitHub and free hosting. By the end you have a portfolio of working sites to show clients or employers, and a solid base to learn frameworks later.$q$, $q$GCI India Faculty$q$, $q$Hands-on projects$q$, $q$code$q$, $q$Web Development Course Online – HTML, CSS, JavaScript | GCI India$q$, $q$Learn web development online: HTML, CSS and JavaScript with real projects, GitHub and live hosting. Build a portfolio of responsive websites.$q$, $q$["HTML structure and semantic tags", "Responsive layouts with CSS", "JavaScript fundamentals and the DOM", "Using Git and GitHub", "Publishing a website online"]$q$::jsonb, $q$[["Do I need to know coding before starting?", "No. The course starts with HTML from scratch."], ["Will I build projects?", "Yes. You build several projects and publish them online to create a portfolio."]]$q$::jsonb, 4.9, 2410, false, true, 50)
