values (6, $q$free-digital-marketing-course$q$, $q$Free Digital Marketing Starter Crash Course$q$, $q$marketing$q$, 0, 0, $q$10 Days$q$, $q$SEO basics, organic social growth, Canva branding and lead generation for small businesses.$q$, $q$A short, practical introduction to digital marketing for students and small business owners. You learn how search engines and social platforms bring customers, how to improve a page for search, how to grow a social media profile without ads, and how to design simple branded posts in Canva. The course ends with a lead-generation checklist you can use for a real shop or service.$q$, $q$GCI India Faculty$q$, $q$Free$q$, $q$campaign$q$, $q$Free Digital Marketing Course in Hindi for Beginners | GCI India$q$, $q$Free beginner course in digital marketing: SEO basics, social media growth, Canva branding and lead generation for small businesses. Enroll free.$q$, $q$["What digital marketing is and the main channels", "SEO basics for beginners", "Growing a social media page organically", "Designing simple branded posts in Canva", "Collecting leads for a small business"]$q$::jsonb, $q$[["Is this digital marketing course free?", "Yes, enrollment and all lessons are free."], ["What should I learn after this?", "If you enjoy it, the paid Google Ads and Meta Ads course teaches paid advertising in depth."]]$q$::jsonb, 4.7, 5630, false, true, 60)
