values (7, $q$o-level-course-online$q$, $q$O Level IT Tools & Network Basics (M1-R5)$q$, $q$computer$q$, 1499, 2999, $q$4 Months$q$, $q$Updated NIELIT syllabus with solved past papers and exam-ready practice.$q$, $q$O Level is a foundation-level IT course from NIELIT that many students choose after school to start a career in computers. This course covers the IT Tools and Network Basics paper (M1-R5): how computers and operating systems work, word processing, spreadsheets, presentations, the internet and basic networking. Solved past papers and practice questions help you get used to the exam style.$q$, $q$GCI India Faculty$q$, $q$NIELIT O Level$q$, $q$lan$q$, $q$O Level Course Online (NIELIT M1-R5) in Hindi | GCI India$q$, $q$Prepare for the NIELIT O Level M1-R5 paper online: IT tools, operating systems, office software and networking with solved past papers.$q$, $q$["Computer and operating-system fundamentals", "Word processing, spreadsheet and presentation tools", "Internet and networking basics", "Emerging technologies and cyber safety", "Solved past papers for revision"]$q$::jsonb, $q$[["Does this course cover the whole O Level?", "This course covers the IT Tools and Network Basics paper (M1-R5). Check the NIELIT website for the other papers."], ["Is it taught in Hindi?", "Yes, lessons use simple Hindi with English technical terms."]]$q$::jsonb, 4.8, 1240, false, true, 70)
